    {
      "source": "A resolved <a href=\"../support/DefaultedPageable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>DefaultedPageable</code></a> is post-processed by applying Jackson field-to-property mapping if it contains a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> instance. Customized fields are resolved to their property names. Unknown properties are removed from\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析后的 <a href=\"../support/DefaultedPageable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>DefaultedPageable</code></a> 会在包含一个\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 实例时，通过应用 Jackson 字段到属性的映射进行后处理。自定义字段会被解析为其对应的属性名称，而未知属性则从\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 中移除。",
      "count": 1
    },
