    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> to resolve <a href=\"../support/DefaultedPageable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>DefaultedPageable</code></a> from a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/web/PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> applying field to property mapping.",
